OL,3,AOil spill washes up on UAE beaches
OL,4,Aafter tanker strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn oil spill from a tanker attacked
OL,7,Fnear the Strait of Hormuz is spreading
OL,8,Falong the United Arab Emirates (UAE)
OL,9,Fcoastline, forcing the closure of some
OL,10,Fbeaches and coastal areas.
OL,12,FSatellite images from Monday show the
OL,13,Fbeginnings of the oil spill from a ship
OL,14,Fmatching the location and dimensions of
OL,15,FGem No.2, which was damaged between 9
OL,16,Fand 10 October during a record surge of
OL,17,Fvessel strikes by Iran.
OL,19,FThe slick of oil had spread more than
OL,20,F35km (22 miles) from the tanker by
OL,21,FWednesday, the satellite imagery
OL,22,Fshowed.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
