OL,3,AOil spill washes up on UAE beaches
OL,4,Aafter tanker strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FUAE authorities said on Thursday that
OL,7,Fthe incident is affecting beaches near
OL,8,Fthe northern city of Umm Al Quwain and
OL,9,Fverified video from Friday shows the
OL,10,Foil washing ashore, colouring the water
OL,11,Fblack.
